        "toolDescription": "=Use this tool to save client intake information to the spreadsheet.\n\nWhen calling this tool, provide these parameters:\n\ntimestamp: Current date and time in format \"YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS\"\nchatId: The Telegram chat ID from the conversation  \nclientName: The client's full name they provided\ncontactInfo: Their phone number or email address\npracticeArea: One of: \"Family Law\", \"Personal Injury\", \"Estate Planning\", \"Business Law\"\nlegalIssue: Brief description of their legal matter\nurgency: One of: \"immediate\", \"within a week\", \"within a month\", \"not urgent\"\nstatus: Always set to \"New Lead\"\n\nONLY call this tool after you have collected ALL required information:\n- Client name\n- Contact information (phone or email)\n- Practice area\n- Description of legal issue\n- Urgency level\n\nAfter successfully saving, tell the client their information has been recorded and the attorney will contact them within 24 hours.",
